SYSTEM a certificate import where a corrected file replaces the first
REPORTS message
RUNS
    import
    replace

PLACE pdf ONE OUTSIDE
    SAYS a PDF from anywhere: the business system, a hand edit, another system, or a source nobody has named
PLACE register MANY LASTING
    SAYS one record for each certificate number
PLACE files MANY LASTING
    SAYS the library of PDFs, one file for each certificate number
PLACE message ONE REPORT

FAULT the pdf cannot be read ABOUT pdf
FAULT a page has no number ABOUT pdf
FAULT the pdf is a scan with no text ABOUT pdf
FAULT a field was edited by hand into a form the import does not read ABOUT pdf
FAULT the number on the pdf is not this certificate's ABOUT pdf
    SAYS a wrong number: one allocated to another certificate, or one never used
FAULT the pdf is not a form the import knows ABOUT pdf
    SAYS a layout from a source nobody has named
FAULT the form is a variant the business system does not make yet ABOUT pdf
    SAYS a form known to be wrong, needed in the register all the same
OPEN the pdf comes from another system
    SAYS nobody has decided what an import from another system may do

SEQ import
    check it
    split it
    record it

SEQ replace
    check it
    rewrite it

ACTION check it
    READS
        pdf
        register
    REFUSE WHEN a field was edited by hand into a form the import does not read
    ACCEPT WHEN the form is a variant the business system does not make yet
        SAYS the upload is held for review before anything is saved
        BECAUSE the register needs these certificates now, and the proper form is not agreed yet

ACTION split it
    READS pdf
    CREATE files MANY FROM pdf
        LATER STANDS
        BECAUSE the file is the certificate as it was uploaded
    REFUSE
        WHEN ANY
            the pdf cannot be read
            a page has no number
            the pdf is a scan with no text
            the pdf is not a form the import knows
            files already has the member
        SAYS the upload is held for review and says why: never a success with nothing imported
    ACCEPT WHEN files is given a key twice
        BECAUSE pages that reuse a number one after another are one certificate

ACTION record it WHEN NOT the pdf comes from another system
    READS pdf
    CREATE register MANY FROM pdf
    REFUSE WHEN register already has the member
        SAYS the number is already in the register, so the upload is held for review
    ACCEPT WHEN register is given a key twice
        BECAUSE the split made one certificate of the pages that share a number

ACTION rewrite it
    READS pdf
    REPLACE files FROM pdf
    REPLACE register FROM pdf
    REFUSE
        WHEN ANY
            the pdf cannot be read
            a page has no number
            the pdf is a scan with no text
            the pdf is not a form the import knows
            files holds another's member
            register holds another's member
        SAYS the corrected file is held for review and says why
    ACCEPT WHEN files holds what is kept nowhere
        BECAUSE the library keeps each file's earlier versions
    SAYS a corrected file replaces the one imported, and its record is rewritten from it
